{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Operator Type Structure.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Operator Type Structure.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender operator type structure blender operator type structure","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Operator Type Structure.md","fileName":"Blender Operator Type Structure.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender Operator Type Structure","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-14 00:20\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Blender Operator and Event System]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender Operator and Event System","Blender Operator RNA Properties","Blender Operator Type Registration","Blender Operator Type Registry","Blender Operator Instance Structure","coreblenderdevelopment.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Operator Type Structure.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Operator Type Structure.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender operator type structure blender operator type structure","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Operator Type Structure.md","fileName":"Blender Operator Type Structure.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender Operator Type Structure","heading":"Blender Operator Type Structure","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"`wmOperatorType` is the runtime definition of a Blender operation. It stores a user-facing name and description, a unique identifier, flags, [[Blender Operator RNA Properties]], an optional modal key map, and function pointers for execution, polling, invocation, cancellation, interface, and other behavior.\n\nThe type is populated during [[Blender Operator Type Registration]] and found later through the [[Blender Operator Type Registry]]. When a call begins, Blender combines this reusable definition with a new [[Blender Operator Instance Structure]] that carries the operation's current values and transient state.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender Operator and Event System","Blender Operator RNA Properties","Blender Operator Type Registration","Blender Operator Type Registry","Blender Operator Instance Structure","coreblenderdevelopment.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Operator Type Structure.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Operator Type Structure.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender operator type structure blender operator type structure","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Operator Type Structure.md","fileName":"Blender Operator Type Structure.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender Operator Type Structure","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[coreblenderdevelopment.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender Operator and Event System","Blender Operator RNA Properties","Blender Operator Type Registration","Blender Operator Type Registry","Blender Operator Instance Structure","coreblenderdevelopment.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}